{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And a man who takes his sister</b> — juxtaposed את אחותו to בהמה, for both are found with him in the house; and juxtaposed to it נדה, which is also found with him always." "<b>and she sees his nakedness</b> — ונכרתו לעיני בני עמם. A hint to what they said: one who gazes at that place will have blind children, and this is וראה את ערותה — that he gazes at that place — and ונכרתו לעיני בני — that the children will have their eyes cut off."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:09.613373022Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}